{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/nanase.nishino/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/12/17/photo_5-thumb.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"寂しいって思ったら\n寂しくなるから\nもう思わないんだぜヽ(｡>▽<｡)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ん～～～～～！ななせまる！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"-"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日はまた長い時間\nみんなとお仕事の日でした"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"待ち時間は\nせいたん、まりかと寝たり\nまあやとコーンスープ作ったり\nまりか、ちはるとギャアギャア笑った。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うん！\nめっちゃめっちゃ楽しかったえへ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"-"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてまゆ毛がいつもより\n凛々しかったんで、とってみました！\nどうですか\n凛々しい西野"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"-"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そういえば！\n乃木坂46クリスマスのイベント\n銀座ソニービルであります\nわたしは、21日(水)と25日(日)に\n出させてもらいます"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"年に一度のクリスマスを\n皆さんと一緒に過ごせるとは∑('ω'ﾉ)ﾉ\nなんて良いこと∑('ω'ﾉ)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"-"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近、鳥さんグッズを\n2つ買いました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"バイッッッ"}],"source":"archive"}